  tardive dyskinesia in older adults with first‐generation and second‐generation antipsychotics: a systematic review    
  and meta‐analysis", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE The advent of second-generation antipsychotics (SGAs) in the 1990s         
  brought optimism that neuroleptic-induced tardive dyskinesia (TD) may become relegated to history. Whether or not     
